       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-PAYLOAD-GRIP.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-PAYLOAD-GRIP-PROOFS.
           05  WS-DIPOLE-CAPTURE-OK        PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-POSITION-ACCURACY-OK     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-SAFETY-CHECK-OK          PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-GRIPPER-LATENCY-OK       PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-GRIPPER-SEAL-OK          PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-PAYLOAD-GRIP-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-PPK-PROVEN           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-PPK-CODE           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-CAPTURE-AND-ACCURACY.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-SAFETY-AND-LATENCY.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-PPK-PROOFS.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-CAPTURE-AND-ACCURACY.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-DIPOLE-CAPTURE-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-POSITION-ACCURACY-OK.
       2000-EVALUATE-SAFETY-AND-LATENCY.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-SAFETY-CHECK-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-GRIPPER-LATENCY-OK.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-PPK-PROOFS.
           IF WS-DIPOLE-CAPTURE-OK = 1 AND
              WS-POSITION-ACCURACY-OK = 1 AND
              WS-SAFETY-CHECK-OK = 1 AND
              WS-GRIPPER-LATENCY-OK = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-GRIPPER-SEAL-OK
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-PPK-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-PPK-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-PPK-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-PPK-CODE.
